{
  "schema": "lgpe-gamedata-v1",
  "format": "LGPE-message",
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_main_0480_rocket_m1_01",
      "hash": "6258d6e3740e5dd7",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳！就是[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳！\\c\\n[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳就是那個最近老是\\n給我們礙事的小孩對吧！？"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_main_0480_rocket_m2_01",
      "hash": "8e5fbee9d57839c0",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "都是[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳幹的好事，\\n火箭隊的面子全丟光了！"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_main_0480_rocket_m3_01",
      "hash": "e60c0af171f799b5",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "再這樣下去，\\n我們就沒臉去見老大了！"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_main_0480_rocket_f1_01",
      "hash": "8c0ba2ae99d8afd2",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "所以我們……\\n得給[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳一點顏色瞧瞧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_main_0480_kanna_01",
      "hash": "a9a0a74348c0618b",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "？？？「住手！"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_main_0480_kanna_02",
      "hash": "a9a0a84348c0633e",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "面對一個小孩子\\n還要以多欺少……\\r\\n這我可看不下去。"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_main_0480_rocket_m1_02",
      "hash": "6258d7e3740e5f8a",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "這傢伙又是啥鬼！\\n一起幹掉算了！"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_main_0480_kanna_03",
      "hash": "a9a0a94348c064f1",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "？？？「這邊３個人我來對付。"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_main_0480_kanna_11",
      "hash": "a9a42b4348c377ae",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "那邊那傢伙能拜託[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳嗎？"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "id": "msg_main_0480_select_01",
      "hash": "68ac863d3423b95a",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "交給我吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "id": "msg_main_0480_select_02",
      "hash": "68ac853d3423b7a7",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "有點困難……"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "id": "msg_main_0480_kanna_04",
      "hash": "a9a0aa4348c066a4",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "？？？「答得很好！\\n那我們上吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "id": "msg_main_0480_kanna_05",
      "hash": "a9a0ab4348c06857",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "？？？「別說這種沒志氣的話！\\n我們上吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "id": "msg_main_0480_rocket_m1_03",
      "hash": "6258d8e3740e613d",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "明明只是個小鬼，\\n怎麼會強成這樣！"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "id": "msg_main_0480_rocket_f1_02",
      "hash": "8c0ba1ae99d8ae1f",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "我們明明是三對一，\\n卻完全奈何不了那傢伙……！"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "id": "msg_main_0480_rocket_f1_03",
      "hash": "8c0ba0ae99d8ac6c",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "那隻冰屬性寶可夢也太強了，\\n妳究竟是何方神聖……"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "id": "msg_main_0480_kanna_06",
      "hash": "a9a0ac4348c06a0a",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "科拿「寶可夢聯盟的[VAR COLOR(0006)]四天王[VAR COLOR(0000)]之一，\\n科拿就是我。"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "id": "msg_main_0480_kanna_12",
      "hash": "a9a42a4348c375fb",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "要不要我連你們\\n也一起凍起來呀？"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "id": "msg_main_0480_rocket_m1_04",
      "hash": "6258d1e3740e5558",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "四……四天王！？\\n就、就不用勞您大駕了～！！"
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "id": "msg_main_0480_kanna_07",
      "hash": "a9a0ad4348c06bbd",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "科拿「[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳還挺有兩下子的嘛！\\n比我想像的還厲害呢！"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "id": "msg_main_0480_kanna_08",
      "hash": "a9a09e4348c05240",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "原來如此，\\n[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳在收集道館徽章啊。"
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "id": "msg_main_0480_kanna_09",
      "hash": "a9a09f4348c053f3",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "我很期待有一天\\n[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳能來挑戰寶可夢聯盟喔。"
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "id": "msg_main_0480_kanna_10",
      "hash": "a9a42c4348c37961",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "那麼就再見了。"
    }
  ],
  "unpaired_labels": [
    {
      "id": "msg_main_event_0480_max",
      "hash": "6dde8fb1b706475b"
    }
  ]
}
